{"meta":{"id":"ai-usage","category":"aide/common-rules","title":"AI 활용","subtitle":"(프롬프트 구조·그라운딩·단계 분리)","summary":"프롬프트 구조, 가이드 단일화, 데이터 선정, 응답 그라운딩, 판정 단계 분리, json/puml 활용","tags":["aide","규칙","ai","json"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-linux-install","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-100/70 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-50/80 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-100/80\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 border border-indigo-200/50 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>\n      1-rules\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">aide Common Rules</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    AI 활용 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-normal text-indigo-400 font-serif\">(프롬프트 구조·그라운딩·단계 분리)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/50 border border-indigo-100/70 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">문서 범위:</strong> AI에 판정/정리를 맡길 때의 프롬프트 구성, 데이터 전달, 결과 검증 규칙\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">활용 원칙</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs bg-white\">\n    <table class=\"table-fixed-layout text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[28%]\">항목</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[72%]\">내용</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100 font-normal text-stone-700\">\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">프롬프트 구조</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">기준 가이드 및 역할 + 데이터로 나눠 구성</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">가이드 단일화</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">기본 가이드 + 케이스별 가이드 규칙을 하나로 정해 두고 반복적으로 재사용</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">전달 데이터 선정</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">전체 데이터를 넘기지 않고, 판정에 사용할 규칙적인 데이터만 골라서 전달</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">응답 그라운딩</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">고정된 값(ID)을 기준으로, AI 결과 데이터에 지어낸 ID가 있는지 재확인</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">AI 판정 단계 분리</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">한 번에 판정하지 않고 여러 파이프라인으로 나눠 후보군을 좁혀 감</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">기존 언어 활용</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">json, puml 다이어그램 등 이미 쓰이는 언어 체계로 자료를 정리해 전달</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">기존 언어 활용 예</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">json 형태</strong> — 기본 가이드(점수 판정 기준, 데이터 해석)</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">puml 형태</strong> — 관계 그래프화(단순화된 온톨로지 방식)</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl bg-stone-50/80 p-3\">\n    <pre class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-stone-700 font-mono overflow-x-auto\">// json — 기본 가이드\n{\n  \"role\": \"판정자\",\n  \"score\": { \"A\": \"기준 충족\", \"B\": \"일부 충족\", \"C\": \"미충족\" },\n  \"data\": { \"id\": \"고정 ID — 응답에서 그대로 사용\" }\n}</pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl bg-stone-50/80 p-3\">\n    <pre class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-stone-700 font-mono overflow-x-auto\">' puml — 관계 그래프\n@startuml\n[항목A] --> [항목B] : 포함\n[항목B] --> [항목C] : 참조\n@enduml</pre>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>aide Common Rules</span>\n  <span>AI 활용</span>\n</div>\n","path":"aide/common-rules/ai-usage","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"aide","title":"aide","path":"aide"},{"id":"common-rules","title":"1-rules (공통 규칙)","path":"aide/common-rules"}],"hasImage":false}